00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,947
Speaking, task two. Card number 10. You are at the information centre. You want to go on a city tour. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:14,057
You are at the information centre. You want to go on a city tour.

3
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,761
Hello. How can I help you?

4
00:00:22,967 --> 00:00:25,655
Hello, when does the city tour start?

5
00:00:25,867 --> 00:00:28,233
The tour starts at 11 o'clock.

6
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:34,467
How much is it?

7
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,700
A ticket costs 150 crowns.

8
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,592
What language is the tour in?

9
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,033
The tour is in Czech and English.

10
00:00:51,233 --> 00:00:52,533
How long does it take?

11
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:54,792
The tour takes about two hours.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
